# Repository-level USE masks: Portage applies them to this overlay's own
# packages (UseManager's per-repository package.use.mask), whatever profile
# is selected.

# USE=ghcbootstrap builds GHC with an external hadrian, and 9.14.1 needs
# ~dev-haskell/hadrian-9.14.1, which neither ::gentoo (hadrian-9.8.4 at most)
# nor this overlay packages. Without the mask the flag only yields an
# unsatisfiable dependency. Lift it together with a hadrian-9.14.1 ebuild.
=dev-lang/ghc-9.14.1 ghcbootstrap
